<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδεής</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>somewhat deficient, inferior;</i> used only in 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδεέστερος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of persons, <i>lower in
				degree,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				134
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνίδια τῶν ἀνθρώπων καὶ τῇ γνώμῃ
					καὶ τῇ γλώσσῃ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					13.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>younger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMasp.
				23.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1708.37
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πολλῷ
				ὑποδεεστέρων</span> with <i>resources</i> much
				<i>inferior,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.89
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸς ἑωυτοῦ ῥέει
			-έστερος,</span> of the Nile, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη ἐκείνης -τέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					289e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηλοῦται . . ὑποδεέστερα ὄντα
				τῆς φήμης</span>
			<i>inferior</i> to report, i. e. exaggerated, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστι δὲ τοῦτο ὑ.,</span> of
			bee-bread, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				623b24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστέρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.87
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				4.4.6
			</span></i>: neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδεέστερα</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.3.9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
